WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.070
Speaker 1: All right.

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:03.540
I've been saying for some time, I think tomorrow's
election is the beginning.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.560
I don't think it's the end of a phase.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.299
I think it's the beginning of a phase.

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:10.710
It's going to be the beginning of a phase
in which Republicans take whatever wins they

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.540
get tomorrow and they're going to get some
we don't know how many.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.320
We don't know what they'll control, but they're
going to get some wins tomorrow and they are

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:23.449
going to use those wins overtly to try to
set up a presidential election in 2024 where

00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:24.449
they can't lose.

00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:31.630
And what I mean by that is even if their opponent
gets more votes, they will try to find a way

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:34.660
to still get their candidate in the Oval Office.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:40.059
It is increasingly looking like Donald Trump
may be that candidate.

00:00:40.059 --> 00:00:46.110
Axios has published an exclusive report that
Donald Trump is planning to announce his candidacy

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.520
on November 14th.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.000
Jonathan Swan reporting.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.960
Former President Trump's inner circle is discussing
announcing the launch of a 2024 presidential

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:59.790
campaign on November 14, with the official
announcement possibly followed by a multi-day

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:03.030
series of political events.

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:04.030
Why it matters.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:08.320
Trump and his top advisers have been signaling
for weeks that a 2024 announcement is imminent.

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:12.340
But the discussions reached the point that
allies are blocking off days in their calendars

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:16.390
for the week after the midterms and preparing
to travel.

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:19.970
Trump long planned to announce shortly after
the midterms, even toyed with announcing before

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.400
November eight to try to get ahead of rivals.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.210
In recent weeks, Trump has been inching closer
and closer to straight up, saying that he

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:29.470
is running now.

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:33.009
It is possible that he will indeed announce
on November 14th.

00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:36.150
It's also possible that he will announce tonight.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:40.689
And the reason I say that is he straight up
said it last night at his rally in Florida.

00:01:40.689 --> 00:01:42.130
Let's take a listen to what he had to say.

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:47.440
Speaker 2: I will probably have to do it again,
but stay tuned.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:51.259
Speaker 1: So the crowd cheers for a while.

00:01:51.259 --> 00:01:53.549
And then in a moment, we'll turn the audio
back up.

00:01:53.549 --> 00:01:57.549
Donald Trump says, keep an eye on my rally
in Ohio tomorrow.

00:01:57.549 --> 00:01:58.549
That's tonight.

00:01:58.549 --> 00:02:02.430
And we're going to be live with that rally,
indeed.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:06.200
Take a listen to what Donald Trump ultimately
said about it.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:12.780
Speaker 2: That's pretty good.

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:15.420
Thank you.

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:22.000
Stay tuned to tomorrow night.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:36.530
In the great state of Ohio State, we have
a big win, a big rally there for JD.

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.530
We have a big, big, big rally.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:38.530
Speaker 1: Yep.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:39.530
So it may be tonight.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:45.349
It may be next Monday, but at this point,
it doesn't seem as if this is all for nothing.

00:02:45.349 --> 00:02:49.129
It does appear as though he is setting up
a run.

00:02:49.129 --> 00:02:54.340
And when I say this is the most important
midterm election I've ever covered.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:58.690
A huge part of the reason is because it's
a setup election.

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:01.709
Well, that almost got that almost got dicey.

00:03:01.709 --> 00:03:05.640
It's a setup election for 2024.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:10.519
And I believe that the next two years are
going to be completely insane and we're going

00:03:10.519 --> 00:03:16.849
to need to really be on our guard, because
by sheer stupidity, to some degree, they failed

00:03:16.849 --> 00:03:19.489
to really come close to stealing it in 2020.

00:03:19.489 --> 00:03:22.540
They're going to be way more prepared this
time around.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:24.099
And we need to be ready for that.

00:03:24.099 --> 00:03:27.120
I'll be live on YouTube, Twitch and Facebook
tonight with the Ohio rally.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:04:52.650
Also, we've got an Obama rally and then we
will have live election results tomorrow night.

